{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123539","id":4544014874,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDtgqGg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123539","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123539.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123539.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123539","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123539/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123539/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123539/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d4fabb5d67dcdcbe601d7cadb4002b9b079cbc5c","number":123539,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add unit tests for `FontVariation`","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n`FontVariation` is listed as lacking test coverage in #43440 and currently has none. This adds tests for its property accessors, its change-notification behaviour, and — using a variable font — the OpenType variation axes themselves.\n\n## Additional information\n\n### Test data\n\nNo font currently in the repository exposes variation axes, so this adds an ASCII subset of the variable Inter font (41 KB) as `tests/data/fonts/InterVariable-ASCII.woff2`, with a matching `COPYRIGHT.txt` entry. It deliberately lives in the test data rather than in `thirdparty/fonts`, which `editor/themes/SCsub` globs into the editor binary.\n\n### Behaviour covered\n\n- **OpenType variation axes change glyph metrics** — a `wght` of 900 measures wider than a `wght` of 100, and distinct coordinates resolve to distinct font RIDs.\n- **Embolden changes glyph metrics** — at the strength the editor theme itself uses to synthesize its bold font.\n- **Spacing changes measured size** — glyph spacing applies to the 8 glyphs of `\"Test text\"` but not to its space, space spacing only to the space, and top/bottom spacing to the line height rather than the width.\n- **Without modifications it measures like its base font.**\n- **Changed signal is only emitted when a value differs** — every `FontVariation` setter is guarded by an inequality check before `_invalidate_rids()`, so a redundant set must not invalidate the cached RIDs or emit `changed`.\n- **Changes to the base font are propagated** — `set_base_font()` connects to the base font's `changed` signal and disconnects it on replacement.\n- **Dictionaries are stored as copies** — `set_variation_opentype()` and `set_opentype_features()` call `duplicate()`, so mutating the caller's dictionary afterwards must not reach into the font.\n- **Reset state** — `reset_state()` restores defaults and clears the base font, reached through a `Resource` handle the way resource reloading reaches it.\n- **Default values** and property round-trips.\n\nMetrics produced by Godot's own arithmetic are asserted exactly; metrics that depend on FreeType rasterisation are asserted relationally, so the tests do not become platform-sensitive.\n\n### Verification\n\nBuilt and run on Windows: 11 cases / 68 assertions for `FontVariation`, and the full suite at 1432 cases / 424299 assertions, both passing.\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> *AI disclosure*: I used Claude Code to help draft these tests. I reviewed every assertion against `scene/resources/font.h` and `scene/resources/font.cpp`, and verified all of them by building and running the test suite locally.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-16T04:39:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:37:33Z","closed_at":"2026-09-16T04:56:17Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b0606b6edf0016adfc8f5e1c3c17721b6d4257f7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"exaltedo2:add-font-variation-tests","ref":"add-font-variation-tests","repo":{"id":1372517873,"node_id":"R_kgDOUc718Q","name":"godot","full_name":"exaltedo2/godot","owner":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exalt